config INTC_MT8188_EINT
	bool "MediaTek MT8188 external interrupt controller"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_MEDIATEK_MT8188_EINT_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the external interrupt controller driver for MediaTek MT8188.

	  The controller multiplexes the per-pin external interrupt lines onto
	  one parent interrupt and hands events to whichever driver registered
	  for the line.  On this SoC the GPIO driver is the only consumer.
